WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.210
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:06.480 --> 00:08.000
I thought this project should've been

3
00:08.039 --> 00:10.320
a perfect wrap-up before you left for America.

4
00:10.360 --> 00:11.720
Dammit.

5
00:11.760 --> 00:12.920
We've been played for fools.

6
00:12.960 --> 00:13.960
You told me

7
00:13.960 --> 00:15.640
that there was no way you'd ever be into guys.

8
00:16.560 --> 00:18.120
I admit...

9
00:18.160 --> 00:19.520
that I act like a tyrant

10
00:19.560 --> 00:20.520
and have a nasty temper,

11
00:20.520 --> 00:22.120
but I've never tried to hurt anyone.

12
00:22.120 --> 00:24.200
You think you can just play me for a fool?

13
00:25.120 --> 00:26.280
You wanna die that badly?

14
00:27.680 --> 00:28.800
Okay, maybe a little bit.

15
00:30.360 --> 00:32.119
Every time I ask you something, you know nothing.

16
00:32.119 --> 00:33.240
Dammit.

17
00:34.040 --> 00:35.240
Pite, start talking.

18
00:35.280 --> 00:36.720
Hey, P'Ing.

19
00:38.360 --> 00:39.600
I need to have a word with you.

20
00:41.240 --> 00:42.360
Dammit.

21
01:05.319 --> 01:06.240
P'Ing.

22
01:06.800 --> 01:08.240
Eat your food.

23
01:09.960 --> 01:11.680
You're so sweet. Even blew on it for me?

24
01:24.080 --> 01:25.240
Hello, Mom.

25
02:05.000 --> 02:05.840
What's that?

26
02:06.880 --> 02:07.640
Well,

27
02:08.880 --> 02:09.720
it's a countdown calendar

28
02:09.759 --> 02:11.320
until you leave for America.

29
02:11.800 --> 02:13.920
I want it to be something memorable.

30
02:14.880 --> 02:16.200
Didn't know you do this stuff, too.

31
02:16.240 --> 02:17.880
Yeah, don't worry.

32
02:18.720 --> 02:20.440
I'll keep you busy every single night.

33
02:25.320 --> 02:25.400
[Secret Recipe for Shrimp Porridge]

34
02:59.320 --> 03:02.000
P'Ing, what happened to your face?

35
03:07.760 --> 03:08.560
Look familiar?

36
03:11.320 --> 03:14.360
The investment firm involved with Green Agriculture.

37
03:18.880 --> 03:20.160
Are you not saying anything?

38
03:25.240 --> 03:27.120
It's true I started this company with Itt,

39
03:27.120 --> 03:27.720
but...

40
03:30.720 --> 03:31.520
Damn you...

41
03:33.400 --> 03:35.720
You're a damn good actor.

42
03:36.280 --> 03:37.360
What did I ever do to you?

43
03:38.200 --> 03:39.280
You slept with me,

44
03:39.320 --> 03:40.480
betrayed me,

45
03:40.520 --> 03:42.600
and gave my stuff to your crush.

46
03:44.120 --> 03:46.120
P'Ing, it's not like that.

47
03:46.160 --> 03:47.960
It's true I helped Itt, but...

48
03:48.960 --> 03:50.480
after that storm,

49
03:51.400 --> 03:53.120
I told him I was backing out.

50
03:53.560 --> 03:55.079
I didn't want to hurt you.

51
03:56.440 --> 03:57.560
You helped him

52
03:58.040 --> 03:59.320
but didn't want to hurt me?

53
04:00.480 --> 04:01.720
You sure know...

54
04:04.200 --> 04:06.320
how to keep the surprises coming.

55
04:08.000 --> 04:09.000
-Let go. -P'Ing.

56
04:09.680 --> 04:10.440
Hey.

57
04:11.760 --> 04:12.920
Please hear me out.

58
04:14.600 --> 04:16.519
I used to think you were actually an enemy,

59
04:17.760 --> 04:19.200
but now I know...

60
04:19.360 --> 04:20.640
that you're not like that.

61
04:22.480 --> 04:24.080
You were willing to risk your life for me.

62
04:24.880 --> 04:27.520
I've loved you ever since then.

63
04:31.000 --> 04:31.800
You've loved me?

64
04:39.400 --> 04:41.000
Thanks so much

65
04:41.720 --> 04:44.000
for giving me all the love that wasn't even real.

66
04:46.640 --> 04:48.040
You've accomplished what you wanted.

67
04:49.240 --> 04:50.040
Wow,

68
04:50.159 --> 04:52.159
you even forced yourself to cook for me

69
04:52.600 --> 04:54.000
and made me think I'd get to top you.

70
04:55.240 --> 04:56.520
You're just...

71
04:57.320 --> 04:58.600
an incredible actor.

72
04:58.640 --> 05:00.040
You deserve an Oscar.

73
05:00.960 --> 05:01.760
P'Ing.

74
05:03.160 --> 05:05.240
Please don't treat my feelings like they meant nothing.

75
05:06.680 --> 05:08.480
What happened between us wasn't a lie.

76
05:09.960 --> 05:11.840
I can feel that you really love me.

77
05:14.160 --> 05:14.880
Yeah.

78
05:16.360 --> 05:17.720
I'll admit it.

79
05:17.920 --> 05:19.120
I did love you,

80
05:21.360 --> 05:22.680
but didn't Itt ever tell you?

81
05:23.960 --> 05:25.720
Plenty of people want me.

82
05:26.240 --> 05:27.560
It doesn't have to be you.

83
05:30.080 --> 05:31.440
Listen to me, Yok.

84
05:33.360 --> 05:34.440
From this moment on,

85
05:35.480 --> 05:36.760
you and I...

86
05:38.880 --> 05:40.000
We're over.

87
05:40.040 --> 05:40.920
No, P'Ing.

88
05:40.960 --> 05:42.960
Hey, P'Ing.

89
05:43.159 --> 05:44.000
P'Ing... Hey.

90
05:47.280 --> 05:48.880
I'm leaving tomorrow.

91
05:49.360 --> 05:51.159
We can't end things like this.

92
05:55.440 --> 05:56.360
Let me go.

93
05:56.520 --> 05:58.320
Didn't you tell me

94
05:59.159 --> 06:00.600
that this is my home, too?

95
06:00.640 --> 06:01.440
Shut up.

96
06:02.120 --> 06:04.120
You have no right to call this place home.

97
06:07.640 --> 06:09.040
Give me my mom's necklace.

98
06:09.480 --> 06:10.720
Give me back my mom's necklace.

99
06:12.840 --> 06:13.600
Dammit.

100
06:13.640 --> 06:14.720
You piece of...

101
06:15.440 --> 06:16.240
Damn.

102
06:18.000 --> 06:19.800
Unbelievably disgusting.

103
06:19.800 --> 06:21.120
All of you.

104
06:22.560 --> 06:24.160
All you wanted was to use me.

105
06:24.440 --> 06:25.320
Screw you.

106
06:25.520 --> 06:26.360
Can't believe I lowered myself

107
06:26.400 --> 06:27.600
to your level.

108
06:31.440 --> 06:32.159
P'Ing...

109
06:33.680 --> 06:34.880
Don't do this.

110
06:44.400 --> 06:45.960
If you want to stay, fine.

111
06:45.960 --> 06:47.840
Whatever it is you want, just take it all.

112
06:49.120 --> 06:49.960
-P'Ing... -Let me go.

113
06:50.000 --> 06:51.159
-I said, let me go. -P'Ing.

114
06:51.159 --> 06:52.480
-Let me go. -P'Ing...

115
07:48.960 --> 07:52.280
♪ I know my mouth runs hot ♪

116
07:52.960 --> 07:56.120
♪ I know I bite the hand ♪

117
07:56.840 --> 08:00.040
♪ I laugh when I should stop ♪

118
08:00.840 --> 08:03.760
♪ Then I pull you back in ♪

119
08:04.520 --> 08:07.840
♪ Gold on my bad idea ♪

120
10:24.360 --> 10:25.520
It's true I helped Itt,

121
10:25.560 --> 10:25.800
but...

122
10:25.840 --> 10:26.760
-Please don't treat my feelings -after...

123
10:26.800 --> 10:27.680
-like they meant nothing. -that storm,

124
10:27.720 --> 10:28.280
I told him

125
10:28.280 --> 10:29.160
-I was backing out. -What happened between us

126
10:29.160 --> 10:30.720
-I didn't want to hurt you. -wasn't a lie.

127
10:30.960 --> 10:31.840
-I used to think -I'm leaving...

128
10:31.880 --> 10:32.920
-you were actually an enemy, -tomorrow.

129
10:32.920 --> 10:34.520
We can't end things like this.

130
10:34.520 --> 10:36.000
Isn't this my home, too?

131
10:36.000 --> 10:36.840
Shut up.

132
10:40.880 --> 10:41.880
Mr. Ing...

133
10:44.480 --> 10:45.880
Are you awake?

134
10:49.400 --> 10:50.400
Mr. Ing...

135
10:59.840 --> 11:00.960
Are you up?

136
11:02.120 --> 11:03.400
Get a doctor in here.

137
11:06.120 --> 11:07.680
I don't care if they give me drugs,

138
11:07.720 --> 11:09.000
an injection, or electric shocks.

139
11:09.240 --> 11:11.120
Just make it all stop so I can finally rest.

140
11:15.440 --> 11:18.120
I understand you're too stressed to sleep,

141
11:18.160 --> 11:19.040
but...

142
11:19.080 --> 11:20.640
if you just need rest,

143
11:20.680 --> 11:23.640
that amount of medication might be too much.

144
11:25.840 --> 11:27.600
The expense paperwork

145
11:27.600 --> 11:28.520
has all been sorted out,

146
11:28.520 --> 11:32.120
and I brought some of my husband's clothes for you.

147
11:32.520 --> 11:35.080
You'll have to make do with these.

148
11:37.800 --> 11:39.000
I'm sorry

149
11:41.000 --> 11:43.080
for making you work this late

150
11:43.080 --> 11:45.240
and having you clean up my messes again.

151
11:46.080 --> 11:48.640
It's alright. I'm more than happy to help.

152
11:50.080 --> 11:51.400
You should...

153
11:51.440 --> 11:53.520
take this opportunity to get plenty of rest.

154
12:04.440 --> 12:05.440
Wait.

155
12:15.600 --> 12:16.800
What about that idiot?

156
12:20.560 --> 12:21.400
Mr. Yok?

157
12:21.720 --> 12:22.720
Yeah.

158
12:22.840 --> 12:25.600
He suffered a mild concussion.

159
12:26.040 --> 12:27.800
He was still unconscious when he arrived,

160
12:28.080 --> 12:29.720
but the doctor said

161
12:29.920 --> 12:31.800
there's no internal damage.

162
12:32.160 --> 12:33.960
He should be waking up soon.

163
12:36.240 --> 12:38.000
Already did some digging, huh?

164
12:39.760 --> 12:42.600
Would you like to go see him?

165
12:42.600 --> 12:43.400
No.

166
12:46.760 --> 12:47.920
Have you contacted Mr. Phet?

167
12:48.640 --> 12:51.440
Yes. He should be here any moment.

168
12:56.480 --> 12:59.520
Are you going somewhere?

169
13:04.320 --> 13:05.720
Take those clothes back with you.

170
13:05.720 --> 13:07.000
I have my own.

171
13:08.840 --> 13:09.680
I see.

172
13:10.440 --> 13:11.240
Understood.

173
13:12.720 --> 13:15.160
Take all those gifts, too.

174
13:18.560 --> 13:20.160
Arrange for my discharge from the hospital.

175
13:20.760 --> 13:21.720
But the doctor said

176
13:21.720 --> 13:24.280
you should stay for at least one more night.

177
13:24.440 --> 13:25.520
Why do I need to stay?

178
13:26.160 --> 13:27.440
I'm perfectly fine.

179
13:41.720 --> 13:42.600
Mr. Ing...

180
13:47.040 --> 13:47.840
Mr. Ing...

181
14:06.440 --> 14:08.440
Mom, I'm hungry.

182
14:08.720 --> 14:10.320
I'll find you something to eat, okay?

183
14:15.760 --> 14:20.480
♪ Buried underneath my smoke-stained cloak ♪

184
14:22.200 --> 14:27.640
♪ I wore my pride to shield my broken side ♪

185
14:27.720 --> 14:28.520
Mom...

186
14:28.720 --> 14:30.200
Please be okay, Mom.

187
14:30.480 --> 14:31.400
Mom...

188
14:33.000 --> 14:33.760
Mom.

189
14:33.800 --> 14:35.400
Relatives aren't allowed inside.

190
14:35.760 --> 14:36.720
Mom.

191
14:37.560 --> 14:39.320
Please wait outside.

192
14:40.240 --> 14:41.280
Mom...

193
14:46.520 --> 14:47.560
Mom.

194
14:50.800 --> 14:53.840
♪ I carry thorns inside my chest ♪

195
14:54.040 --> 14:54.880
Mom...

196
14:54.880 --> 14:57.280
♪ The pain has never let me rest ♪

197
14:57.280 --> 15:03.280
♪ If I could turn back the tide once more, ♪

198
15:05.000 --> 15:10.400
♪ Maybe I could find what I'm looking for ♪

199
15:13.240 --> 15:18.480
♪ Words unsaid ♪

200
15:18.480 --> 15:21.080
♪ Silence echoes ♪

201
15:22.800 --> 15:28.720
♪ In the depths of memories ♪

202
15:42.960 --> 15:44.560
Thanks so much

203
15:45.280 --> 15:47.400
for giving me all the love that wasn't even real.

204
15:47.400 --> 15:48.240
Can't believe I lowered myself

205
15:48.280 --> 15:49.280
-to your level. -You slept with me,

206
15:49.320 --> 15:50.080
betrayed me.

207
15:50.120 --> 15:51.000
Unbelievably disgusting.

208
15:51.040 --> 15:52.120
And you gave my stuff to your crush.

209
15:52.160 --> 15:53.240
All of you.

210
15:53.280 --> 15:54.280
I said, let me go.

211
15:54.280 --> 15:54.760
Let me...

212
16:00.360 --> 16:01.080
Yok...

213
16:02.000 --> 16:02.920
Are you awake?

214
16:10.080 --> 16:11.040
How are you feeling?

215
16:14.040 --> 16:15.200
Why are you here?

216
16:16.680 --> 16:18.160
Mr. Ing's secretary called me.

217
16:19.520 --> 16:20.960
What happened between you and Mr. Ing?

218
16:22.800 --> 16:24.400
I can feel that you really love me.

219
16:24.480 --> 16:25.480
I said, let me go.

220
16:27.800 --> 16:28.920
Where's P'Ing?

221
16:29.520 --> 16:30.480
Have you met him yet?

222
16:30.720 --> 16:31.600
Not yet.

223
16:32.200 --> 16:33.080
Why do you ask?

224
16:34.880 --> 16:35.680
Well...

225
16:36.800 --> 16:38.520
I was hit by a car yesterday.

226
16:40.120 --> 16:41.640
Please don't tell Mom and Dad yet.

227
16:42.520 --> 16:43.960
I don't want them to worry.

228
16:47.040 --> 16:48.840
But Mr. Ing's secretary told me...

229
16:49.040 --> 16:50.480
that you just fell down.

230
16:53.480 --> 16:54.160
I did.

231
16:55.120 --> 16:58.160
I was getting out of the car, but I fell down.

232
17:01.120 --> 17:02.320
Tell me the truth.

233
17:02.920 --> 17:04.359
What exactly happened?

234
17:06.400 --> 17:07.319
P'Phet,

235
17:08.160 --> 17:09.960
I have my reasons.

236
17:10.000 --> 17:12.000
Can you not ask me about it right now?

237
17:14.640 --> 17:16.119
I'll let everything else slide for now,

238
17:17.000 --> 17:18.480
but I'll need to sort out your problems.

239
17:24.240 --> 17:25.200
Hello, sir.

240
17:25.720 --> 17:26.800
Get some rest.

241
17:27.200 --> 17:28.920
I'll pick you up once you're discharged.

242
17:29.720 --> 17:30.520
Okay.

243
17:49.680 --> 17:50.640
Take good care of him.

244
17:50.800 --> 17:51.680
Yes, sir.

245
18:19.120 --> 18:20.440
[Calling P'Ing]

246
18:30.280 --> 18:32.760
[P'Ing]

247
18:32.800 --> 18:34.800
[Block Caller]

248
18:34.840 --> 18:35.160
[Yok]

249
18:35.200 --> 18:36.160
[Yok: Blocked]

250
18:37.200 --> 18:38.840
You don't know when to quit, do you?

251
18:50.240 --> 18:51.880
Oh, Mr. Ing?

252
18:52.640 --> 18:54.800
What brings you here so suddenly?

253
18:56.960 --> 18:57.880
Please come in.

254
19:04.320 --> 19:06.320
If I'd known you were coming,

255
19:06.840 --> 19:08.760
I would've made sure the place was spotless.

256
19:10.080 --> 19:12.280
Yeah, it's fine.

257
19:13.200 --> 19:14.320
I don't mind.

258
19:16.720 --> 19:19.000
You're staying here tonight?

259
19:20.440 --> 19:21.160
Yeah.

260
19:21.880 --> 19:24.080
Let me put your suitcase away.

261
19:25.960 --> 19:26.960
This way, please.

262
19:47.320 --> 19:49.440
Are you still working at Vince's barber shop?

263
19:50.080 --> 19:51.920
He said that I'm slow

264
19:52.560 --> 19:53.880
and not very sharp,

265
19:54.920 --> 19:57.440
so he suggested I learn hairdressing somewhere else.

266
19:57.600 --> 19:58.440
That's for the best.

267
19:58.920 --> 20:01.320
You shouldn't be hanging around him anyway.

268
20:03.240 --> 20:04.520
Would you like to sit down first

269
20:04.720 --> 20:06.880
to see if it's too soft or too hard?

270
20:09.320 --> 20:10.400
It's okay.

271
20:11.720 --> 20:12.800
I can sleep on pretty much anything.

272
20:28.920 --> 20:31.040
I'll let them keep you company tonight.

273
20:39.880 --> 20:40.800
What?

274
20:40.800 --> 20:41.560
Do you like it?

275
20:41.600 --> 20:43.280
I'll buy a couple for you.

276
20:43.520 --> 20:45.160
-No, thanks. -What?

277
20:45.400 --> 20:46.240
Why not?

278
20:46.360 --> 20:48.240
I thought kids these days were into this stuff.

279
20:48.880 --> 20:50.920
Trends come and go every other day.

280
20:51.160 --> 20:52.240
It's nonsense.

281
20:54.120 --> 20:55.240
So you're saying...

282
20:55.800 --> 20:58.000
that you're too cool for this?

283
20:58.040 --> 20:59.920
If you're old-fashioned, just admit it.

284
20:59.960 --> 21:01.400
Like, those who can't keep up with the trends.

285
21:01.880 --> 21:04.160
I call my style classic.

286
21:05.040 --> 21:06.840
"I call my style classic."

287
21:06.880 --> 21:08.480
Why are you trying so hard to look cool?

288
21:10.960 --> 21:11.920
Put them away.

289
21:13.280 --> 21:14.880
I'm not really fond of these things.

290
21:17.280 --> 21:18.080
Okay.

291
21:25.960 --> 21:27.520
Well, good night.

292
22:04.600 --> 22:06.640
Young Master, you have a visitor.

293
22:26.280 --> 22:28.680
After everything you've done to get this chance,

294
22:29.160 --> 22:30.440
you're throwing it away now?

295
22:35.080 --> 22:36.200
It's my fault.

296
22:37.360 --> 22:39.560
I'll pay the contract termination fee myself.

297
22:39.560 --> 22:41.320
It's not about the money.

298
22:43.840 --> 22:45.240
What made you change your mind?

299
22:47.320 --> 22:49.200
I've lost someone...

300
22:50.200 --> 22:51.600
I never should've let go.

301
22:55.720 --> 22:57.400
Just because of love?

302
22:58.520 --> 22:59.760
It made you throw away the chance

303
22:59.800 --> 23:02.360
to be in the world-class boxing ring?

304
23:08.560 --> 23:09.680
P'Khun,

305
23:10.920 --> 23:12.240
I've really thought this through

306
23:12.880 --> 23:14.280
and decided to quit professional boxing.

307
23:15.920 --> 23:17.080
I used to think...

308
23:17.720 --> 23:19.640
that being in the ring

309
23:21.160 --> 23:23.120
was the only time I could be myself,

310
23:28.040 --> 23:30.360
but then someone made me feel the same way.

311
23:30.840 --> 23:32.080
How were you raised?

312
23:32.200 --> 23:34.000
We're humans. Just do whatever you want.

313
23:34.240 --> 23:35.440
Eat whatever you want.

314
23:35.680 --> 23:37.280
Why overthink everything?

315
23:37.800 --> 23:38.880
-Twist upward. -Like this?

316
23:38.880 --> 23:39.880
-Twist. -Twist upward?

317
23:40.440 --> 23:41.000
Like this?

318
23:41.040 --> 23:42.040
P'Ing.

319
23:42.040 --> 23:42.960
Do you actually want to learn?

320
23:47.280 --> 23:48.280
P'Ing.

321
23:48.280 --> 23:50.280
If you ever need to let it all out,

322
23:51.920 --> 23:52.960
I'm right here for you.

323
23:53.920 --> 23:55.000
Let me give you a reward.

324
23:56.800 --> 23:58.480
Your heart belongs to me.

325
23:58.840 --> 24:01.160
No matter where in the world you go,

326
24:01.400 --> 24:03.040
you'll still be thinking of me.

327
24:07.000 --> 24:08.920
Maybe I never wanted to be a pro boxer.

328
24:11.320 --> 24:13.200
I'm sorry for letting you down.

329
24:31.880 --> 24:34.080
That was for the talent you're throwing away

330
24:34.560 --> 24:36.720
and the concern I wasted on you.

331
24:44.560 --> 24:45.720
As for the fee,

332
24:46.600 --> 24:47.760
I'll take care of it.

333
24:49.160 --> 24:49.920
At most, I'll just say,

334
24:49.960 --> 24:51.280
"This kid's lost his mind,

335
24:52.280 --> 24:53.600
and it's better that he's out of the gym."

336
25:00.480 --> 25:02.360
Just be a sparring partner for me sometimes.

337
25:03.680 --> 25:04.960
None of these new kids

338
25:06.400 --> 25:08.600
can match your stamina.

339
25:11.960 --> 25:12.760
I will.

340
25:14.520 --> 25:16.360
Thank you, P'Khun.

341
26:00.320 --> 26:00.960
[Itt: P'Ing.]

342
26:00.960 --> 26:02.720
[If you're going to blame someone, blame me.]

343
26:02.720 --> 26:03.920
[Don't blame Yok.]

344
26:11.000 --> 26:11.920
Mr. Ing.

345
26:12.360 --> 26:13.440
Mr. Muangthep just called.

346
26:13.440 --> 26:15.320
He's found someone who can stop

347
26:15.320 --> 26:16.800
the Pattaya project from getting approved.

348
26:17.480 --> 26:18.400
But...

349
26:18.440 --> 26:21.560
shall we proceed with it?

350
26:27.400 --> 26:29.080
Tell him...

351
26:31.080 --> 26:32.440
that if he pulls this off,

352
26:33.920 --> 26:36.120
he'll get everything he wants from me.

353
26:38.400 --> 26:39.920
But if the project gets suspended,

354
26:41.200 --> 26:42.720
you, Mr. Itt, and Mr. Yok will...

355
26:42.720 --> 26:43.760
Secretary Piang,

356
26:44.120 --> 26:46.400
I've spent the last two days thinking it over.

357
26:46.720 --> 26:49.400
Stealing our condo units

358
26:49.440 --> 26:51.640
and reaching out to that couple

359
26:53.880 --> 26:55.760
must've taken a lot of planning.

360
26:57.080 --> 27:00.240
If I let those brats get away with this,

361
27:01.680 --> 27:02.520
don't you call me

362
27:02.560 --> 27:03.920
Ing of Araya Group.

363
27:05.640 --> 27:06.720
After this,

364
27:06.920 --> 27:08.440
they're going to lose that land

365
27:08.440 --> 27:09.800
they practically got for free.

366
27:12.320 --> 27:13.120
Green Agriculture

367
27:13.160 --> 27:15.040
and those brats' firm

368
27:15.920 --> 27:17.960
are in for some serious damage.

369
27:19.800 --> 27:21.800
Whether they can find the cash flow

370
27:23.720 --> 27:25.480
or pull their shares out in time,

371
27:26.800 --> 27:27.800
in the end,

372
27:29.120 --> 27:30.920
they're screwed either way.

373
27:32.480 --> 27:34.040
But they're just getting started.

374
27:34.080 --> 27:36.080
If we cut off their investment funds,

375
27:36.120 --> 27:37.600
they won't give up that easily.

376
27:38.080 --> 27:39.840
They'll keep dragging it out,

377
27:39.880 --> 27:41.000
refusing to let it end.

378
27:43.560 --> 27:44.520
Secretary Piang,

379
27:46.320 --> 27:47.520
you have the wrong idea.

380
27:48.320 --> 27:49.640
I'm not trying to drag this out.

381
27:50.520 --> 27:52.440
I want them destroyed.

382
27:53.640 --> 27:54.800
And I'll be waiting

383
27:54.800 --> 27:57.080
for the final act of this play

384
27:58.120 --> 28:00.040
and watching them come up empty-handed.

385
28:00.720 --> 28:01.760
Eventually,

386
28:02.120 --> 28:04.720
they'll end up suing each other, right?

387
28:07.680 --> 28:09.320
It's going to be entertaining as hell.

388
28:45.480 --> 28:45.720
[P'Ing.]

389
28:45.720 --> 28:46.160
[Can you please answer me?]

390
28:46.200 --> 28:46.600
[How are you feeling?]

391
28:46.640 --> 28:47.040
[Have you eaten?]

392
28:47.080 --> 28:47.520
[P'Ing, where are you?]

393
28:47.560 --> 28:48.000
[Are you really not gonna reply?]

394
28:48.000 --> 28:48.520
[Are you at the office?]

395
28:48.520 --> 28:49.120
[I'm about to be discharged from the hospital.]

396
28:49.160 --> 28:49.920
Mr. Yok,

397
28:49.960 --> 28:51.520
I've finalized

398
28:51.560 --> 28:52.440
your discharge papers.

399
28:52.440 --> 28:53.640
Shall we leave now?

400
28:53.680 --> 28:54.560
Where's P'Phet?

401
28:56.040 --> 28:56.920
I'm afraid I don't know.

402
29:00.400 --> 29:01.880
Thank you for the information.

403
29:02.560 --> 29:03.520
If you'll excuse me.

404
29:05.680 --> 29:08.040
Dad, what happened to P'Phet?

405
29:08.040 --> 29:09.320
Still have the nerve to ask me that?

406
29:09.360 --> 29:11.080
This is all because of the mess you made.

407
29:14.160 --> 29:16.240
Quit Araya Group right now

408
29:16.280 --> 29:18.080
and stop seeing Ing once and for all.

409
29:18.800 --> 29:19.600
Yok,

410
29:20.000 --> 29:20.600
your brother

411
29:20.640 --> 29:22.680
has been taken in by the Crime Suppression Division

412
29:22.680 --> 29:24.080
for questioning.

413
29:24.560 --> 29:25.320
They found evidence that

414
29:25.320 --> 29:27.240
Phet was involved in corruption with the Pattaya project.

415
29:29.040 --> 29:30.160
That's impossible.

416
29:30.520 --> 29:32.200
He would never do anything like that.

417
29:34.800 --> 29:36.240
What does P'Ing have to do with this?

418
29:36.280 --> 29:37.680
It's plain as day.

419
29:37.840 --> 29:39.480
As soon as his project was taken away,

420
29:39.520 --> 29:40.920
your brother immediately ran into trouble.

421
29:41.320 --> 29:43.640
This is clearly an act of revenge.

422
29:44.080 --> 29:46.520
P'Ing would never play dirty like that.

423
29:47.160 --> 29:48.360
There must be some mistake.

424
29:48.400 --> 29:50.080
You're still calling him P'Ing?

425
29:50.320 --> 29:52.400
With a situation like this,

426
29:53.160 --> 29:54.560
if we can't find evidence

427
29:54.560 --> 29:56.280
to prove your brother's innocence,

428
29:56.600 --> 29:58.680
his future is completely over.

429
30:00.120 --> 30:01.720
His entire life,

430
30:01.840 --> 30:04.240
he's never caused me any trouble.

431
30:04.440 --> 30:05.560
But then you started working

432
30:05.560 --> 30:07.200
for those people at Araya Group.

433
30:07.240 --> 30:08.640
That's why this happened.

434
30:09.120 --> 30:11.120
I shouldn't have let you work for them.

435
30:14.960 --> 30:16.120
I'll find out

436
30:16.240 --> 30:17.680
who's really behind this.

437
30:21.600 --> 30:23.040
I need to take this call.

438
30:23.040 --> 30:23.960
Wait.

439
30:26.520 --> 30:27.520
Look at him.

440
30:29.280 --> 30:30.880
What should we do?

441
30:33.680 --> 30:35.760
[Incoming Call: Itt]

442
30:38.240 --> 30:38.920
Yok.

443
30:39.120 --> 30:41.520
My brother has found someone to stop the Pattaya project.

444
30:41.640 --> 30:42.920
He's not going to give up.

445
30:43.320 --> 30:44.760
I have nothing to do with your plans.

446
30:45.000 --> 30:46.120
You don't need to tell me anything.

447
30:46.280 --> 30:48.080
I just want you to be careful.

448
30:48.200 --> 30:50.000
I heard P'Phet would be taken in for questioning.

449
30:50.440 --> 30:52.120
It must be P'Ing's doing.

450
30:53.240 --> 30:55.400
You know how vengeful he is.

451
30:55.920 --> 30:56.640
Yok,

452
30:57.920 --> 30:59.520
you should work with me again.

453
31:05.800 --> 31:07.120
It's not P'Ing's doing.

454
31:07.120 --> 31:09.040
Still making excuses for him?

455
31:09.720 --> 31:10.600
Do you like him so much

456
31:10.640 --> 31:12.120
that you'd actually let P'Phet go to jail?

457
31:17.200 --> 31:18.080
Dad...

458
31:18.080 --> 31:19.240
I'm heading out.

459
31:19.280 --> 31:20.320
Give me a moment.

460
31:21.280 --> 31:22.680
-Look at him. -Yok...

461
31:23.120 --> 31:24.400
Where are you going?

462
31:25.160 --> 31:26.400
We haven't finished talking yet.

463
31:31.960 --> 31:33.440
[System: No SIM]

464
31:42.720 --> 31:44.600
Hello?

465
31:46.080 --> 31:46.920
Who is this?

466
31:47.520 --> 31:49.520
Oh? And who are you?

467
31:49.560 --> 31:52.160
The owner of this phone wanted me to ask that question.

468
31:53.440 --> 31:54.760
Put P'Ing on the phone.

469
31:55.280 --> 31:57.240
Mr. Ing, you have a call.

470
32:01.520 --> 32:02.320
Hello?

471
32:03.080 --> 32:04.600
It's me. Where are you?

472
32:10.080 --> 32:11.680
I think he's your type.

473
32:12.160 --> 32:14.400
If you want him, tell him where we are.

474
32:15.800 --> 32:17.160
Hi, handsome.

475
32:17.680 --> 32:20.320
We're at SB Bar.

476
32:25.040 --> 32:28.120
Oh? Why'd he hang up so fast?

477
32:28.600 --> 32:30.080
He probably...

478
32:30.680 --> 32:32.680
can't wait to see us.

479
32:52.680 --> 32:54.680
Wow, we got someone.

480
33:02.520 --> 33:03.520
-Do you know who he is? -Go ahead.

481
33:03.520 --> 33:04.160
-Who are you? -You can order

482
33:04.200 --> 33:05.120
whatever you want.

483
33:05.320 --> 33:06.920
Don't worry about the money.

484
33:08.080 --> 33:09.400
I said don't worry.

485
33:20.160 --> 33:20.960
P'Ing?

486
33:21.680 --> 33:23.440
Who is this?

487
33:24.360 --> 33:25.480
Oh...

488
33:26.360 --> 33:27.320
He's the youngest son

489
33:27.320 --> 33:29.440
of Minister Pongpaisan.

490
33:30.400 --> 33:31.600
Is that so?

491
33:33.400 --> 33:35.000
Tell me.

492
33:35.720 --> 33:37.240
Between me and him,

493
33:37.920 --> 33:39.200
who's hotter?

494
33:43.200 --> 33:44.480
It has to be you, Mr. Ing.

495
33:46.200 --> 33:47.000
P'Ing.

496
33:49.800 --> 33:51.600
I need to talk to you in private.

497
33:54.440 --> 33:55.520
Hey.

498
33:56.280 --> 33:58.440
Take Mr. Muangthep to the room next door

499
33:58.840 --> 34:00.360
and get him a bottle of Royal Salute.

500
34:00.680 --> 34:01.760
Put it on my tab.

501
34:02.600 --> 34:03.800
Thank you very much.

502
34:04.920 --> 34:05.680
Thank you.

503
34:06.080 --> 34:07.360
Keep me steady, alright?

504
34:08.000 --> 34:09.080
Then...

505
34:09.440 --> 34:10.520
I'm leaving.

506
34:10.560 --> 34:11.440
Wait.

507
34:12.520 --> 34:13.920
What's there to be afraid of?

508
34:14.639 --> 34:15.719
You're with me.

509
34:22.239 --> 34:23.520
Get the hell out!

510
34:25.679 --> 34:26.760
Please excuse me.

511
34:41.560 --> 34:44.760
What brings the honorable Minister Pongpaisan's son

512
34:46.040 --> 34:47.920
to a place like this?

513
34:49.600 --> 34:50.360
Want some?

514
35:03.520 --> 35:05.160
Shouldn't you be boxing

515
35:05.200 --> 35:06.880
in America right now?

516
35:07.040 --> 35:08.760
What happened? Isn't that your dream?

517
35:10.760 --> 35:12.480
Or was all that talk...

518
35:13.040 --> 35:15.040
about wanting to be a boxer

519
35:16.080 --> 35:18.480
just more of your lies?

520
35:19.280 --> 35:20.080
Tell me.

521
35:21.520 --> 35:22.560
I'm so confused right now,

522
35:22.600 --> 35:23.240
P'Ing.

523
35:24.720 --> 35:26.320
Was Phet called in for questioning

524
35:26.640 --> 35:27.960
because of you?

525
35:30.120 --> 35:32.120
So you only came because of this?

526
35:35.040 --> 35:36.960
I just wanted to know the truth.

527
35:41.360 --> 35:42.360
Jeez.

528
35:43.640 --> 35:45.400
You want the truth? Fine, I'll give it to you.

529
35:45.440 --> 35:47.240
I stopped the Pattaya project,

530
35:47.280 --> 35:48.360
and as for your brother,

531
35:48.360 --> 35:50.800
I called the police on him. Happy now?

532
35:56.040 --> 35:57.360
Is it true?

533
35:59.520 --> 36:00.320
Why?

534
36:03.800 --> 36:05.840
Do you think the great Young Master Yok...

535
36:07.160 --> 36:08.640
would make mistakes?

536
36:09.360 --> 36:10.160
Huh?

537
36:10.880 --> 36:13.120
You know exactly what kind of person I am, don't you?

538
36:21.600 --> 36:23.600
Instead of wasting your time on me,

539
36:24.360 --> 36:26.360
you should be helping your brother.

540
36:27.560 --> 36:28.480
Otherwise,

541
36:29.520 --> 36:32.120
his future is going to be ruined by my hand.

542
36:34.800 --> 36:35.640
Got it?

543
36:40.200 --> 36:41.800
If you're looking for revenge, take it out on me.

544
36:41.840 --> 36:43.520
Why drag P'Phet into this?

545
36:43.960 --> 36:45.360
You're saying he knew nothing, huh?

546
36:45.640 --> 36:47.120
That brother of yours...

547
36:47.400 --> 36:48.440
If it weren't for him,

548
36:48.440 --> 36:49.680
how could someone like you

549
36:49.720 --> 36:50.880
possibly stab me in the back?

550
36:50.920 --> 36:51.880
Seriously?

551
36:57.560 --> 36:58.880
He didn't do anything.

552
37:02.360 --> 37:03.480
Are you mad at me?

553
37:04.120 --> 37:05.000
Go ahead.

554
37:06.200 --> 37:07.080
Punch me.

555
37:08.040 --> 37:08.960
Hit me.

556
37:10.400 --> 37:12.400
Aren't you a boxer?

557
37:13.200 --> 37:14.000
Come on.

558
37:15.120 --> 37:15.920
Punch me.

559
37:17.800 --> 37:18.680
Let me tell you...

560
37:20.880 --> 37:21.680
P'Ing,

561
37:22.200 --> 37:23.120
please stop.

562
37:34.640 --> 37:35.840
It's your mom.

563
37:36.800 --> 37:38.200
She seems pretty desperate.

564
37:40.000 --> 37:41.200
Aren't you going to pick up?

565
37:45.520 --> 37:46.280
Yok,

566
37:46.520 --> 37:48.240
come home now.

567
37:48.440 --> 37:50.560
Dad's found someone who can help.

568
37:50.800 --> 37:52.680
You have to go there with us right now.

569
37:54.560 --> 37:55.360
Yes, Mom.

570
37:59.960 --> 38:01.360
Let me tell you something.

571
38:03.480 --> 38:04.280
This...

572
38:04.680 --> 38:05.800
is just the appetizer.

573
38:06.560 --> 38:07.720
We're not over yet.

574
38:07.960 --> 38:09.360
You cannot date anyone else.

575
38:10.320 --> 38:11.880
I'll be keeping an eye on you.

576
38:21.600 --> 38:25.440
P'Ing, if you want to take your revenge on me, do it.

577
38:26.440 --> 38:27.480
But please,

578
38:28.120 --> 38:29.520
don't ruin my brother.

579
38:30.560 --> 38:31.880
Once this is settled,

580
38:32.440 --> 38:33.720
I'll come back to you.

581
38:33.760 --> 38:34.760
When that time comes,

582
38:35.560 --> 38:36.960
you can do whatever you want

583
38:37.520 --> 38:38.480
to me.

584
38:39.160 --> 38:40.160
Who said you could leave?

585
38:42.120 --> 38:43.360
Things between us aren't over.

586
38:43.520 --> 38:45.040
You're not leaving me.

587
38:54.360 --> 38:55.400
Dammit.

588
38:56.560 --> 38:57.440
Pite,

589
38:58.160 --> 38:58.880
Itt,

590
38:59.560 --> 39:00.480
Yok...

591
39:01.880 --> 39:03.960
Not one of you knows how to be grateful.

592
39:13.320 --> 39:14.720
I'd really appreciate your help

593
39:14.920 --> 39:16.320
with Phet's case.

594
39:27.720 --> 39:29.000
How did it go?

595
39:29.040 --> 39:30.840
Can they help us at all?

596
39:30.920 --> 39:32.360
They said that

597
39:33.280 --> 39:34.760
the whistleblower information

598
39:34.800 --> 39:37.440
and the source of the evidence are currently sealed.

599
39:38.600 --> 39:40.640
Even though they trust Phet,

600
39:41.080 --> 39:42.760
they can't step in to help.

601
39:43.920 --> 39:45.360
It looks like

602
39:46.080 --> 39:48.000
this is going to be more complicated than we thought.

603
39:55.360 --> 39:56.360
Dad,

604
39:56.640 --> 39:58.160
if he was really framed,

605
39:58.160 --> 39:58.960
is it possible that

606
39:58.960 --> 40:00.840
someone secretly opened an account under his name

607
40:01.160 --> 40:03.240
and transferred that dirty money into it?

608
40:04.840 --> 40:07.240
In that case, we need to check offshore accounts as well.

609
40:09.800 --> 40:11.880
I think we need a more specialized approach.

610
40:13.200 --> 40:14.720
Mom, your brother, Uncle Phao,

611
40:14.760 --> 40:15.800
has a son named Phu

612
40:16.200 --> 40:17.800
who graduated with a cybersecurity degree.

613
40:21.720 --> 40:23.040
Then talk to him immediately.

614
40:24.960 --> 40:25.920
Drive.

615
40:37.880 --> 40:39.160
He didn't do anything.

616
40:39.520 --> 40:40.920
Don't ruin my brother.

617
40:41.520 --> 40:43.280
Why drag P'Phet into this?

618
40:44.440 --> 40:45.440
Hey, Ju.

619
40:48.320 --> 40:49.000
Yes?

620
40:50.120 --> 40:50.920
Come here.

621
41:03.480 --> 41:04.880
In your eyes,

622
41:06.840 --> 41:08.640
am I a good person or a bad one?

623
41:13.000 --> 41:13.920
I think...

624
41:14.720 --> 41:16.160
you're a good person

625
41:16.600 --> 41:18.320
who's just intentionally acting mean.

626
41:24.680 --> 41:25.480
Why is that?

627
41:27.160 --> 41:29.680
I think whether someone is good or bad

628
41:30.000 --> 41:31.480
isn't determined by their words,

629
41:32.760 --> 41:34.440
but by their actions.

630
41:38.640 --> 41:41.840
Last time, I was so clumsy

631
41:42.840 --> 41:44.440
and made a mess of your hair,

632
41:46.120 --> 41:47.640
but you still gave me a tip.

633
41:51.400 --> 41:52.600
You're kind.

634
42:01.200 --> 42:02.200
Look at you.

635
42:05.160 --> 42:06.880
You're so naive.

636
42:16.080 --> 42:17.160
Hold on.

637
42:18.080 --> 42:18.800
What?

638
42:19.080 --> 42:20.080
Close your eyes.

639
42:20.560 --> 42:22.480
There's a stray hair on your eyelid.

640
42:59.800 --> 43:01.120
I'm going for a smoke.

641
43:47.760 --> 43:49.320
-Good morning. -Hello, sir.

642
43:49.360 --> 43:51.760
The new runway collection suits you perfectly.

643
43:52.080 --> 43:53.160
You have good taste.

644
43:55.000 --> 43:57.400
Ms. Koi and Mr. Third reached out early this morning.

645
43:57.720 --> 43:59.960
It seems they want to turn over a new leaf,

646
43:59.960 --> 44:01.480
just as you predicted.

647
44:01.960 --> 44:03.160
Just leave them hanging.

648
44:03.640 --> 44:04.640
Don't bother getting back to them.

649
44:05.160 --> 44:06.560
Let them squirm.

650
44:12.440 --> 44:14.840
I'm going to sue Yok and Itt's company

651
44:15.280 --> 44:17.400
for theft of trade secrets.

652
44:17.960 --> 44:19.200
Get the legal team on this.

653
44:19.240 --> 44:20.400
It's time they learned

654
44:21.040 --> 44:22.440
what happens

655
44:22.440 --> 44:23.440
when they mess with what's mine.

656
44:24.120 --> 44:25.040
Understood.

657
44:26.080 --> 44:27.400
Have you contacted Mr. Phet yet?

658
44:27.800 --> 44:28.640
Yes.

659
44:28.640 --> 44:29.800
I've scheduled the appointment

660
44:29.840 --> 44:32.080
for the day after the board meeting.

661
44:32.120 --> 44:33.000
Good. That way,

662
44:33.840 --> 44:35.840
we can get everything settled before the end of the year

663
44:35.840 --> 44:37.040
and make a clean break.

664
44:37.680 --> 44:38.400
Alright.

665
44:38.720 --> 44:39.840
This afternoon, summarize and review

666
44:40.120 --> 44:42.320
the board meeting agenda

667
44:42.440 --> 44:43.320
because...

668
44:43.640 --> 44:45.960
my relatives are extremely anxious.

669
44:46.280 --> 44:47.880
I need to appease them.

670
44:49.040 --> 44:50.400
My dear old dad

671
44:50.440 --> 44:52.400
told everyone about that mess in Pattaya.

672
44:53.000 --> 44:54.080
Now everyone's in a tizzy.

673
44:55.000 --> 44:56.600
Understood. I'll take care of it.

674
44:56.680 --> 44:57.360
Yeah.

675
44:58.360 --> 44:59.160
Please excuse me.

676
45:02.800 --> 45:03.680
Phet...

677
45:04.880 --> 45:06.320
Are you okay?

678
45:10.360 --> 45:12.640
Someone used your name to open an offshore account.

679
45:14.000 --> 45:15.000
A very sophisticated plan.

680
45:15.840 --> 45:18.160
P'Phu and I have spent the last two days

681
45:18.160 --> 45:19.440
tracing the money trail

682
45:19.480 --> 45:20.400
through seven offshore accounts.

683
45:20.800 --> 45:22.520
All the transfers came from a virtual account,

684
45:23.440 --> 45:25.640
but the login IP is fully encrypted.

685
45:26.040 --> 45:27.040
We need to find the IP address

686
45:27.080 --> 45:28.920
and identify the person behind the account

687
45:29.040 --> 45:30.480
before we can dig any deeper.

688
45:31.680 --> 45:33.360
As for the whistleblower,

689
45:33.600 --> 45:35.480
P'Phu has managed to hack into the external system.

690
45:35.520 --> 45:37.000
He's currently checking the call logs.

691
45:40.560 --> 45:44.800
[P'Phu]

692
45:44.920 --> 45:46.000
I only found some of it.

693
45:46.280 --> 45:48.240
Before P'Phet was taken in for questioning,

694
45:48.520 --> 45:50.680
there was only one person besides the DSI officers

695
45:50.840 --> 45:52.720
who had ties to the Pattaya project,

696
45:52.760 --> 45:53.760
and that was...

697
45:53.960 --> 45:55.960
the secretary of Araya Group's CEO.

698
45:58.480 --> 46:00.280
Can you find out what they talked about?

699
46:00.480 --> 46:02.040
They were in contact twice.

700
46:02.360 --> 46:03.200
The first time,

701
46:03.640 --> 46:04.560
the office said

702
46:04.600 --> 46:05.960
they had received the documents she sent

703
46:05.960 --> 46:07.600
and thanked her for the cooperation.

704
46:07.600 --> 46:08.720
As for the second time,

705
46:08.800 --> 46:10.800
it was to schedule their next meeting

706
46:11.080 --> 46:12.600
to ask for more information.

707
46:14.160 --> 46:15.280
When is the meeting scheduled for?

708
46:15.560 --> 46:16.560
The day after tomorrow.

709
46:19.880 --> 46:20.640
Got it.

710
46:22.360 --> 46:23.640
Thanks a lot, Phu.

711
46:25.040 --> 46:25.960
My pleasure.

712
46:27.720 --> 46:28.600
Yok,

713
46:30.160 --> 46:31.680
call Ing right now

714
46:31.840 --> 46:34.440
and ask him exactly what he wants.

715
46:34.760 --> 46:36.280
Tell him to be straight with us

716
46:36.560 --> 46:38.200
instead of playing games behind our backs.

717
46:41.640 --> 46:42.440
Dad,

718
46:43.360 --> 46:44.320
contacting him privately

719
46:44.360 --> 46:45.640
could lead to a misunderstanding.

720
46:46.080 --> 46:47.160
Let's take it easy for now.

721
46:49.480 --> 46:50.600
The day after tomorrow,

722
46:51.480 --> 46:52.960
I'll go to Araya Group.

723
46:58.040 --> 46:58.720
Alright.

724
46:59.120 --> 47:01.120
Those in favor of purchasing the land development plan

725
47:01.160 --> 47:03.640
for a resort in northern Phuket,

726
47:04.040 --> 47:05.200
please raise your hands.

727
47:16.960 --> 47:17.960
Then it's settled.

728
47:18.240 --> 47:19.040
We'll purchase the land in Phuket

729
47:19.040 --> 47:20.440
after the New Year.

730
47:20.800 --> 47:22.400
Meeting adjourned for today.

731
47:27.280 --> 47:28.160
Secretary Piang,

732
47:28.840 --> 47:30.200
please get in touch with Mr. Yang

733
47:30.360 --> 47:31.880
about the land purchase in Phuket.

734
47:32.520 --> 47:34.040
Please keep it strictly professional.

735
47:34.880 --> 47:35.880
Understood.

736
47:51.360 --> 47:52.160
Ing...

737
47:54.400 --> 47:55.840
Grandpa has been trying to call you,

738
47:55.840 --> 47:56.920
but he hasn't been able to get through.

739
47:57.960 --> 47:59.920
He wants you to visit him for the New Year.

740
48:03.480 --> 48:05.080
Mm, I know.

741
48:07.680 --> 48:08.480
Ing,

742
48:09.400 --> 48:10.560
about the lawsuit,

743
48:12.000 --> 48:13.480
I want to ask you

744
48:13.520 --> 48:14.720
to think it over one more time.

745
48:16.240 --> 48:18.920
After all, Itt is still your brother.

746
48:20.840 --> 48:21.640
Is that so?

747
48:22.280 --> 48:24.080
When he was stabbing me in the back,

748
48:24.440 --> 48:25.960
did he see me as a brother?

749
48:27.800 --> 48:29.680
But he realizes he was wrong.

750
48:32.200 --> 48:33.520
And he's promised me

751
48:33.560 --> 48:34.360
that he'll stop.

752
48:38.960 --> 48:40.440
Tomorrow is New Year's Eve.

753
48:40.520 --> 48:42.280
I want you to come home for dinner,

754
48:43.040 --> 48:44.840
and I'll make him apologize to you.

755
48:46.320 --> 48:47.640
And if you're still mad,

756
48:48.600 --> 48:50.240
I'll even give him a beating for you.

757
48:50.280 --> 48:51.080
Is that fair?

758
48:54.240 --> 48:55.040
Oh, yeah?

759
49:04.120 --> 49:06.200
We're here to gather more information

760
49:06.640 --> 49:08.720
regarding Mr. Pruttha's case.

761
49:09.320 --> 49:10.680
Could you tell us

762
49:10.840 --> 49:13.640
what role Mr. Pongpruet had in the Pattaya project

763
49:14.160 --> 49:17.080
while you were working on it?

764
49:17.560 --> 49:20.480
Oh, he introduced me to the officials

765
49:20.520 --> 49:22.600
at various government agencies in Pattaya.

766
49:22.880 --> 49:23.880
During that time,

767
49:24.040 --> 49:26.840
did you have any shared financial interests?

768
49:28.960 --> 49:30.520
Financial interests?

769
49:35.000 --> 49:36.400
I was actually...

770
49:38.720 --> 49:40.360
hoping there would be some.

771
49:58.000 --> 49:59.360
When you decided to back out,

772
49:59.400 --> 50:00.760
why didn't you tell me right away?

773
50:00.760 --> 50:02.400
You ungrateful son.

774
50:02.600 --> 50:04.520
What are you doing? Can't you hear me?

775
50:05.000 --> 50:06.000
You should stop, Itt.

776
50:06.320 --> 50:07.760
Don't make things any worse.

777
50:07.920 --> 50:09.320
This is a very big deal.

778
50:09.320 --> 50:10.400
You really had no idea?

779
50:10.600 --> 50:12.920
The view from inside the room is different

780
50:13.280 --> 50:14.320
from the one up on the rooftop.

781
50:14.600 --> 50:15.800
Give Ing some time.

782
50:16.000 --> 50:17.880
No one gives a damn about me.

783
50:18.120 --> 50:19.720
They only care about what they can gain from me.

784
50:21.000 --> 50:22.280
I said, let go.

785
50:22.800 --> 50:24.360
What makes you think

786
50:24.880 --> 50:26.120
I'd ever submit to you?

787
50:26.200 --> 50:27.080
You idiot.
